### 0. Nieautoryzowany dostęp – powinno zwrócić 401
GET http://localhost:9080/car-rental-1.0-SNAPSHOT/api/vehicles
Accept: application/json

### 1.1 Rejestracja nowego użytkownika (bez autoryzacji)
POST http://localhost:9080/car-rental-1.0-SNAPSHOT/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "login": "charlie",
  "email": "charlie@example.com",
  "password": "charlie123"
}


### 2.1 USER (alice) – pobieranie wszystkich pojazdów (dozwolone)
GET http://localhost:9080/car-rental-1.0-SNAPSHOT/api/vehicles
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6YWxpY2UxMjM=


### 2.2 USER (alice) – próba dodania pojazdu (powinno zwrócić 403)
POST http://localhost:9080/car-rental-1.0-SNAPSHOT/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6YWxpY2UxMjM=

{
  "vin": "VIN-999",
  "brand": "Ford",
  "model": "Focus",
  "fuel": "PETROL",
  "transmission": "MANUAL",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "dailyRate": 120.00
}


