### 2.4 ADMIN (bob) – pobranie pojedynczego pojazdu VIN-999
GET http://localhost:9080/car-rental-1.0-SNAPSHOT/api/vehicles/VIN-101
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic Ym9iOmJvYjEyMw==


